ColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Customize your top header, choose a light or dark theme, add a custom favicon, and integrate with Google Analytics.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Custom sites</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Visualize data from databases in different ways (e.g. donut, bar, and line charts).</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Unlimited charts</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Blocks are pieces of content you add to a page (e.g. to-do checkboxes, paragraphs, bullet points, etc.).</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Unlimited collaborative blocks</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">A per file size limit may apply to any file that you upload to a Notion page or database.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Unlimited file uploads</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Connect to some tools like Slack &amp; Google Drive</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Basic connections</span><span class="PlanFeat