graphy-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Collaborate in Notion databases without giving access to the entire database. Limit access to rows where the collaborator is assigned.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Granular database permissions</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Add a verified badge to pages that are up to date. Appears in search results and AI citations.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Verify any page</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Create teamspaces that can’t be seen or discovered by anyone except those you add. Great for sensitive information like company planning or performance reviews.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Private teamspaces</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Verify ownership of an email domain to access advanced security features including single-sign on.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Domain verification</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote 