odule-scss-module__hCkUHG__regionDisclaimer" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:var(--tatami-color-gray-600)"></span></div></article><article aria-labelledby="_R_1aeeabm_" class="PricingPlanCard-module-scss-module__AkOUza__pricingPlanCard"><div class="PricingPlanCard-module-scss-module__AkOUza__header"><h3 id="_R_1aeeabm_" class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantCardTitle PricingPlanCard-module-scss-module__AkOUza__heading">Enterprise*</h3><div class="PricingPlanCard-module-scss-module__AkOUza__pricingWrap"><span class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantCardTitle PricingPlanCard-module-scss-module__AkOUza__heading"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-100-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-100-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-100-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-100-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Custom pricing</span></span></div><p class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantCardBody PricingPlanCard-module-scss-module__AkOUza__description">For organizations to operate with scalability, control, and security.</p><div class="PricingPlanCard-module-scss-module__AkOUza__ctaWrap"><a class="button-module-scss-module__pIQ4pG__button button-module-scss-module__pIQ4pG__buttonVariantTertiary button-module-scss-module__pIQ4pG__buttonSizeM PricingPlanCard-module-scss-module__AkOUza__cta index-module-scss-module__hCkUHG__ctaFrontUiSecondaryOnAccentMuted" data-analytics-event="click_cta" href="/contact-sales">Contact Sales</a></div></div><div><p class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption index-module-scss-module__hCkUHG__planFeaturesHeading"><strong>Everything in Business, and:</strong></p><div class="index-module-scss-module__hCkUHG__planFeatures"><ul class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatures"><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">When using Notion AI, our LLM providers utilize zero data retention for Enterprise plan workspaces</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Zero data retention with LLM providers</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Access the Notion SCIM API to provision and manage users and groups.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">User provisioning (SCIM)</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Unlock extra permission controls to prevent certain people from sharing pages externally, disable guests, and set workspace-level rules.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Advanced security &amp; controls</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Access a detailed log of security and safety-related activity for your workspace account to identify potential security issues, investigate suspicious behavior, or troubleshoot access.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Audit log</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Our team of Customer Success Managers are experts to help you get the most out of Notion.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Customer success manager</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Connect to SIEM and DLP tools to automatically centralize audit logs &amp; set policies to detect sensitive content in your workspace and trigger automated actions to remediate.</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Security &amp; Compliance connections (DLP, SIEM)</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Establish ownership of your company domain and take actions on workspaces that belong to your verified domain (request ownership transfer, delete, claim)</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Domain management</span></span></span></div></li><li class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeature"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Connect to even more tools</p></div></div><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__planFeatureRow"><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span><span class="PlanFeatures-module-scss-module__0hN6GW__featureLabel">Advanced connections</span></span></span></div></li></ul></div><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography index-module-scss-module__hCkUHG__regionDisclaimer" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:var(--tatami-color-gray-600)"></span></div></article><div class="PricingCardGroup-module-scss-module__rOcwtW__calloutWrapper"><div class="flex flex-col gap-16 surface surfaceBase surface-module-scss-module__CFFfpW__surfaceBase PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__callout"><div class="PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__item"><div class="PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__content"><h3 class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__heading"><strong>Custom Agents</strong></h3><p class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption">AI agents handle repetitive tasks autonomously, so your team doesn’t have to. Free to try, then $10 per 1,000 monthly Notion credits.</p></div><div class="PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__image"><img src="/front-static/pages/pricing/custom-agent-facepile.png" alt="" width="152" height="66" aria-hidden="true"/></div></div><hr class="PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__divider"/><div class="PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__item"><div class="PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__content"><h3 class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__heading"><strong>Workers</strong><span class="badge-module-scss-module__N9sCua__badge badge-module-scss-module__N9sCua__badgeLight">Beta</span></h3><p class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption">Extend Notion with custom code to build agent tools, sync external data, and trigger Notion workflows from anywhere. Free to try now. Starts using credits on October 15. <a class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorTheme InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__underlineOnHover" target="_self" data-analytics-name="pricing_callout_learn_more" data-analytics-event="click_link" data-analytics-context="workers" href="/help/understand-pricing-for-workers"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent">Learn more</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="Arrow-module-scss-module__XcR9Sq__arrow Arrow-module-scss-module__XcR9Sq__arrowAfter">→</span></a></p></div><div class="PricingCalloutBox-module-scss-module__dKJDnq__image"><img src="/front-static/pages/pricing/workers.png" alt="" width="140" height="70" aria-hidden="true"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="index-module-scss-module__hCkUHG__quoteSlot"><figure class="quote-module-scss-module__2NYrkq__quote index-module-scss-module__hCkUHG__quoteStart quote-module-scss-module__2NYrkq__quoteAlignStart"><div class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption accreditation-module-scss-module__rJjRWG__accreditation accreditation-module-scss-module__rJjRWG__column accreditation-module-scss-module__rJjRWG__alignStart"><div class="accreditation-module-scss-module__rJjRWG__logo"><img src="/front-static/logos/generic/en/openai-v2.svg" alt="OpenAI logo" width="95" height="26"/></div></div><blockquote class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalQuote quote-module-scss-module__2NYrkq__blockquote">There’s power in a single platform where you can do all your work out of. Notion is that single place.</blockquote><figcaption><div class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption accreditation-module-scss-module__rJjRWG__accreditation accreditation-module-scss-module__rJjRWG__column accreditation-module-scss-module__rJjRWG__alignStart"><span class="accreditation-module-scss-module__rJjRWG__infoName">Nick Erdenberger</span><span class="accreditation-module-scss-module__rJjRWG__infoMeta">GTM, OpenAI</span></div><div class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption"><a href="https://www.notion.com/customers/openai" class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography linkText-module-scss-module__z5BaEa__linkText linkText-module-scss-module__z5BaEa__colorVariantSecondary linkText-module-scss-module__z5BaEa__hasArrow"><span class="linkText-module-scss-module__z5BaEa__linkContent">Watch video</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="arrow-module-scss-module__WbIAoq__arrow arrow-module-scss-module__WbIAoq__arrowFlipRtl">→</span></a></div></figcaption></figure></div></div><p id="_R_bm_" class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption index-module-scss-module__hCkUHG__plusDisclosure">* Plans may not be available for every workspace.</p></section><section class="spacing-module-scss-module__QiWDZW__marginL index-module-scss-module__hCkUHG__tabletUpOnly"><div class="analyticsScrollPoint-module-scss-module__t5HIlG__analyticsScrollPoint" data-analytics-scroll-point="true" data-analytics-name="comparison_grid"></div><div style="position:static" class="spacing-module-scss-module__QiWDZW__marginS"><h2 class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalHeading">Plans and features</h2><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__pricingGrid"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__stickyHeader"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__columnHeading"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__columnHeading"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami