r:var(--tatami-color-black)"><span>$20</span> <span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-medium-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-medium-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-medium-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-50-medium-letter-spacing);--typography-color:var(--tatami-color-gray-500)"> per seat/month</span></span><a class="button-module-scss-module__pIQ4pG__button button-module-scss-module__pIQ4pG__buttonVariantPrimary button-module-scss-module__pIQ4pG__buttonSizeS PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__buttonCta" data-analytics-event="click_cta" href="/signup?target=plans">Get started</a></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__columnHeading"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Enterprise*</span><a class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__underlineOnHover PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__inlineCta" target="_self" data-analytics-name="get_started_enterprise" data-analytics-event="click_link" href="/contact-sales"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent">Contact us</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="Arrow-module-scss-module__XcR9Sq__arrow Arrow-module-scss-module__XcR9Sq__arrowAfter">→</span></a></div></div><section class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__section"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__sectionLabel"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:var(--tatami-color-gray-500)">Content</span></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__row"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__featureCell"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__fillSpace"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Blocks are pieces of content you add to a page (e.g. to-do checkboxes, paragraphs, bullet points, etc.). Teams who want to try collaborating in Notion can use the Free Plan with up to certain number of blocks before upgrading.</p></div></div><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__contentTextItem" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Pages &amp; blocks</span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typograp