div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" style="height:18px;width:18px;color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__row"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__featureCell"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__fillSpace"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Admin content search provides Workspace owners visibility into the content of their Notion workspace, letting them filter, search, and troubleshoot permissions.</p></div></div><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__contentTextItem" style="--typo