var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Custom data retention settings</span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" style="height:18px;width:18px;color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__row"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__featureCell"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__fillSpace"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Admins can auto-delete AI meeting transcripts on a customizable schedule to meet your data retention policies.</p></div></div><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__contentTextItem" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">AI Meeting Notes transcript deletion</span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" style="height:18px;width:18px;color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div></section><section class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__section"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__sectionLabel"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:var(--tatami-color-gray-500)">Support</span></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__row"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__featureCell"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__fillSpace"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">We’re always around to help. Just click the ( ? ) button at the bottom left on desktop, or tap “Help &amp; support” if you’re on mobile.</p></div></div><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__contentTextItem" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Priority support</span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" style="height:18px;width:18px;color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" style="height:18px;width:18px;color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="1em" style="height:18px;width:18px;color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper-module-scss-module__7Hu80a__icon"><path d="m17.5 5.7-9.375 9.375L2.5 9.45l1.325-1.325 4.3 4.3 8.05-8.05z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__row"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__featureCell"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__fillSpace"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Tailored, proactive around-the-clock support offerings for teams with more specialized needs.</p></div></div><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__contentTextItem" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Premium support</span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Custom</span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__row"><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__featureCell"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipTarget oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__fillSpace"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltip" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip-module-scss-module__QvekfW__tooltipText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorWhite text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeFootnote text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWithMargin">Our team of Customer Success Managers are experts to help you get the most out of Notion.</p></div></div><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__contentTextItem" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Customer success manager</span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"></div><div class="PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__rowCell"><span class="typography-module-scss-module__s4Stoa__typography" style="--typography-font:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--tatami-typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Custom</span></div></div></section><p id="_R_aiabm_" class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalCaption PricingGrid-module-scss-module__SmFM5G__plusDisclosure">* Plans may not be available for every workspace.</p></div></div></section><section id="faq" class="spacing-module-scss-module__QiWDZW__marginL"><div class="analyticsScrollPoint-module-scss-module__t5HIlG__analyticsScrollPoint" data-analytics-scroll-point="true" data-analytics-name="pricing-faq"></div><h2 class="semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__semanticTypography semanticTypography-module-scss-module__Db2fhq__variantGlobalHeading">Questions &amp; answers</h2><div class="Spacer-module-scss-module__lfDwuG__spacer" style="min-height:32px"></div><article class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faqWrap"><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">How does Notion AI use my data?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">We follow our standard <a href="https://notion.so/security" class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-analytics-name="rich_text_link_data protection practices" data-analytics-event="click_link"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent">data protection practices</span></a> to keep your data encrypted and private. Notion AI will not use your data to train our models unless you opt in to a request to share your data.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Any information used to power Notion AI will be shared with AI subprocessors for the sole purpose of providing you with the Notion AI features. We specifically have contractual agreements in place with our AI subprocessors that prohibit the use of customer data to train their models. <a href="https://www.notion.so/help/notion-ai-security-practices" class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-analytics-name="rich_text_link_Learn more about Notion AI security and privacy practices here" data-analytics-event="click_link"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent">Learn more about Notion AI security and privacy practices here</span></a>.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">Where can I find my invoices?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Workspace admins can access, view, and download your workspace&#x27;s invoices by going to <code class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__code">Settings &amp; members</code> → <code class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__code">Billing</code>, then scrolling to <code class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__code">Invoices</code>. There you can click on &quot;View invoice&quot; to see the invoice PDF.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">What are your accepted payment methods?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">We currently accept all major credit and debit card brands.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">What is a block?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">A block is any single piece of content you add to your page, like a paragraph of text, a to-do item, an image, a code block, an embedded file, etc. Think of your page as being made up of these building blocks. Learn more about blocks <a href="https://www.notion.com/help/what-is-a-block" class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-analytics-name="rich_text_link_here →" data-analytics-event="click_link"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent">here →</span></a></p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">What happens when I go over the block storage limit on a Free Plan?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">If you’re using a Free Plan workspace by yourself, you’ll be able to add as many pages and blocks as you like.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">If you’re using a Free Plan workspace with multiple members, you’ll be able to add a limited number of blocks before you have to upgrade. </p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">When you reach the limit, you can still read, edit, and organize existing content blocks as usual, but you won’t be able to add new content blocks.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">Do you offer student discounts?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">The Plus Plan (with a 1-member limit) is free for students and educators. Compared to the Free Plan, you’ll be able to add more guests, have access to more version history, and upload larger files.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Just sign up with your school email address and you’ll immediately gain access to these features. Thousands of school email domains are eligible, not just .edu!</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">For more info &amp; FAQs, <a href="https://www.notion.so/help/notion-for-education" class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-analytics-name="rich_text_link_visit the Notion for Education page" data-analytics-event="click_link"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent">visit the Notion for Education page</span></a>.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">What do the different analytics tiers mean?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider"><strong class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__strong">Basic page analytics (Free and Plus Plans): </strong>Includes a list of page viewers as well as a chart displaying views over time.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider"><strong class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__strong">Advanced page analytics</strong> <strong class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__strong">(Business Plan): </strong>Includes everything above as well as a list of page editors.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider"><strong class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__strong">Workspace analytics (Enterprise Plan):</strong> Includes everything above as well as user level analytics, analytics on all pages in your workspace, and search analytics for content in your workspace.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">How is pricing calculated for the paid plans?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">If you upgrade your workspace to one of the paid plans, you will be charged a fee per member.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Guests are free of charge – but they can only access individual pages they are invited to. In other words, guests won’t be able to see all the team pages under the <code class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__code">Teamspaces</code> section in the left sidebar.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">How do I get charged when I add members to my workspace?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">When you add a new member to your workspace, they will use an existing paid seat if you have any available in your workspace. If you do not have any existing available paid seats, your count of paid seats will increase by 1. Changes in membership that occur mid-month will create prorated charges based on the amount of time remaining in the billing cycle when the paid seat was added.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">For every member you delete from your workspace, you will open up 1 available paid seat. This means you have the option to exchange members in your workspace without paying any additional costs, as long as your total billable seat count remains the same.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">You’ll receive an invoice for any charges accrued by changes in membership on your selected payment method, on the day of the month you initially signed up for your subscription.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Each time your billing period starts (monthly or annual), your count of paid seats will be synchronized so it exactly matches the amount of members present in your workspace.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">How does adding and removing members work?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Whether you&#x27;re on a monthly or yearly billing schedule, your account may be charged on a monthly basis if you make changes in membership. If you added members, your account will be charged a prorated amount based on the percentage of the billing cycle left when a user was added. If you removed members, you will not receive credit but instead will still have use of that seat for a different user for the remainder of the billing period.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">How are paid seats counted?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">A paid seat can be thought of as a license for one member to use your Notion workspace. Workspace owners can view the total paid seat count for their workspace by going to <code class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__code">Settings &amp; members</code> &gt; <code class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__code">Billing</code>. Once you have added a paid seat, you will keep it for the duration of your billing period.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">When your billing cycle renews, either monthly or annually, you will be charged for your plan amount multiplied by the number of members in your workspace, plus any prorated charges for new paid seats added in the past month. Your number of paid seats will be recalculated at each renewal to match the number of members present in the workspace.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider"></p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">What happens when I change plans?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><ul class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__list"><li class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__listItem"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider"><strong class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__strong">Upgrading your plan:</strong> Your account will be upgraded and charged immediately. The amount due will be reduced based on the percentage of the billing cycle left at the time the plan was changed.</p></div></li><li class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__listItem"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider"><strong class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__strong">Downgrading your plan: </strong>Your account will be downgraded at the end of your billing cycle. Learn about how your features may be impacted after a downgrade <a href="https://notion.com/help/plan-downgrade" class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-analytics-name="rich_text_link_here →" data-analytics-event="click_link"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent">here →</span></a></p></div></li></ul></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider"></p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">How do I cancel my paid plan?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Your Notion subscription, annual or monthly, will automatically renew until you cancel it. You can cancel your subscription by going to <code class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__code">Settings</code> in the left-hand sidebar on a desktop computer, then selecting <code class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__code">Billing</code>, then <code class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__code">Change plan</code>. After you cancel, you’ll still have access to all the paid features until the end of your billing cycle.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Learn more about billing in <a href="https://www.notion.com/help/billing" class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-analytics-name="rich_text_link_this article" data-analytics-event="click_link"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent">this article</span></a>.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">What happens if my payment fails? Like if my credit card expires?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Your account email will be notified after each failed payment. Payments may be retried up to 8 times within the next month. </p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">After this, if the payment did not succeed, your workspace will get restricted to limited-access for a period of time before being downgraded to the Free plan.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider"></p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">Can I change my payment method?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">You can change your payment method at any time in your billing settings.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">How do refunds work?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">Our refund policy is simple. If you believe you&#x27;ve made a mistake signing up for a paid Notion subscription online or in-app, please contact us inside the app or email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9febfafef2dff2fef4faf1f0ebf6f0f1b1fcf0f2" class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-analytics-name="rich_text_link_team@makenotion.com" data-analytics-event="click_link"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="0e7a6b6f634e636f656b60617a676160206d6163">[email&#160;protected]</span></span></a>. We&#x27;ll be happy to refund you the full amount (not pro-rated) if you downgrade your subscription within three days of signing up for monthly billing, or within 30 days of signing up for annual billing.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">If you have accidentally added members to your workspace, you can remove those members at any time. If you’ve been charged for members who were accidentally added, we&#x27;re happy to provide a refund of the prorated charges if you reach out within three days of the invoice date (please make sure the additional members have been removed from your workspace when writing in).</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">And if for any reason you&#x27;re unhappy with Notion, please let us know at <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#097d6c6864496468626c67667d606667276a6664" class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-analytics-name="rich_text_link_team@makenotion.com" data-analytics-event="click_link"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="add9c8ccc0edc0ccc6c8c3c2d9c4c2c383cec2c0">[email&#160;protected]</span></span></a> — we&#x27;d love to hear your feedback, and will be happy to work with you to create the best experience possible.</p></div></article></div></details><details class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__faq"><summary class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__question"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionText"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightSemibold text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">What if I live in a region with a mandatory refund policy?</p></div><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__questionToggleWrap"><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggle"><svg class="togglePlus faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__toggleIcon" viewBox="0 0 14 14" style="width:100%;height:100%;display:block;fill:inherit;flex-shrink:0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 0C7.55228 0 8 0.447715 8 1V6H13C13.5523 6 14 6.44772 14 7C14 7.55228 13.5523 8 13 8H8V13C8 13.5523 7.55228 14 7 14C6.44771 14 6 13.5523 6 13V8H1C0.447715 8 0 7.55228 0 7C0 6.44772 0.447715 6 1 6H6V1C6 0.447715 6.44772 0 7 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></summary><div class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__answer"><article class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__richText contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__sans" style="--rich-text-font-config-font-size:var(--tatami-font-size-200);--rich-text-font-config-line-height:var(--tatami-font-line-height-200);--rich-text-font-config-font-family:var(--tatami-font-family-sans);--rich-text-font-config-font-variant-numeric:normal;--rich-text-font-config-color:var(--tatami-color-text-strong)"><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">If you live in the European Union, United Kingdom, or another region with a mandatory refund policy, you may be eligible for a monthly subscription refund past 72 hours. For example, customers in the European Union can receive a full refund for a monthly subscription within 14 days of purchase, rather than 72 hours.</p></div><div class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__bodyLimit" style="--rich-text-limit-max-width:none"><p class="contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__paragraph contentfulRichText-module-scss-module__GleVCa__enableThemeProvider">To request a refund, please contact us inside the app or email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b8ccddd9d5f8d5d9d3ddd6d7ccd1d7d696dbd7d5" class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-analytics-name="rich_text_link_team@makenotion.com" data-analytics-event="click_link"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="463223272b062b272d232829322f29286825292b">[email&#160;protected]</span></span></a>. If you live in a region with a mandatory refund policy, please let us know and we&#x27;ll be happy to assist you.</p></div></article></div></details><footer class="faqDrawers-module-scss-module__ZMoceq__cta"><p class="text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__text text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textWeightRegular text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textColorMedium text-module-scss-module__W75WuG__textSizeBody">Still have more questions? <br/> Learn more in our <a class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__inlineLink InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__colorInherit" target="_self" data-analytics-name="faq_drawer_guidelines" data-analytics-event="click_link" href="/help/guides"><span class="InlineTextLink-module-scss-module__KEwpqq__linkContent">help center</span></a>.</p></footer></article></section></main><div style="display:contents" class="base-module-scss-module__QPCBRq__theme theme-module-scss-module__thoEPa__theme"><footer id="site-footer" data-analytics-scroll-point="true" data-analytics-name="footer" class="su